def $flatten_annotationList(annotationList)

1. Case analysis on annotationList

  1. Case (% matches pattern ``EMPTY`)

    1. Return []

  2. Case (% has type annotation)

    1. (Let annotation be (annotationList as annotation))

      1. Return [annotation]

1. Else Phantom#34

2. If ((annotationList has type annotationListNonEmpty)), then

  1. (Let annotationListNonEmpty be (annotationList as annotationListNonEmpty))

    1. If ((annotationListNonEmpty matches pattern `%%`)), then

      1. (Let (annotationListNonEmpty' annotation) be annotationListNonEmpty)

        1. Return $flatten_annotationList((annotationListNonEmpty' as annotationList)) ++ [annotation]

    1. Else Phantom#35

2. Else Phantom#36

