def $free_typeDefIR(typeDefIR)

1. (Let ((typeParameterIR_expl)*, (typeParameterIR_impl)*) be $typeParameterListIR_of_typeDefIR(typeDefIR))

  1. (Let B_tparams be ({ (typeParameterIR_expl)* ++ (typeParameterIR_impl)* }))

    1. (Let typeIR be $typeIR_of_typeDefIR(typeDefIR))

      1. (Let B_base be $free_typeIR(typeIR))

        1. Return $diff_set<typeId>(B_base, B_tparams)

