def $subst_callableTypeDefIR'(theta, callableTypeDefIR)

1. Case analysis on callableTypeDefIR

  1. Case (% has type actionTypeDefIR)

    1. (Let actionTypeDefIR be (callableTypeDefIR as actionTypeDefIR))

      1. (Let callableTypeIR be $subst_callableTypeIR'(theta, (actionTypeDefIR as callableTypeIR)))

